[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ララ様！\u3000ララ様がご帰還なさったぞ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Queen Lara! Queen Lara has returned!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "領民の男性",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミーケ様とディオーナ様も！\nおかえりなさーい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lady Mieke and Lady Diona too! Welcome back!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "領民の少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl of the Kingdom"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この者たちは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "These people..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "我がララ・キングダムの民たちですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "These are the citizens of the Kingdom of Lara."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ララ様、おかげさまで作物もよく実っております",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Queen Lara, thanks to you, our crops have grown wonderfully."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "領民の女性",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Woman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆、息災で何より",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm relieved to see everyone doing well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミーケ、ディオーナ。早速ですが、わたくしの衣装を\n仕立てることを命じます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke, Diona. I have a task for you—I command you to craft new attire for me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いきなり衣装の仕立てだって？\u3000どういうことだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "New attire, just like that? What's this about?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "極夜の錬金党は壊滅しました。闇に染められた\nこの衣装も、そろそろ役目を終える頃だと思いましたの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Polar Night Alchemists are no more. I believe it's time to retire this darkness-tainted garment."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これからは王にふさわしい\n華やかな装いをいたしましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "From now on, I shall dress in a manner befitting a proper queen."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やたっ！\u3000任せておいて！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! Leave it to us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ララ様にふさわしい、最高の一品をお約束いたします！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We promise to create something truly worthy of you, Queen Lara!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。期待していてよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I look forward to it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それからアンペルにも１着仕立てるように",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And have an outfit made for Empel as well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええっ！？\u3000でも、この錬金術士は……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?! But he..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "王が不問に付すと言葉にした以上、不問です。\n友好の証ですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I declared his past forgiven, and so it shall be. Consider this a token of friendship."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……畏まりました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...As you command."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンペル。この二人は最高の腕を持つ服飾職人ですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel. These two are master tailors of the highest caliber."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、ありがたく受け取らせてもらおう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, I'm grateful to accept."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふむ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "決して豊かではないが、活気がある国だ。\n住人たちの表情も明るい。良い王に恵まれたのだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "While not wealthy, this is a lively kingdom. The citizens' faces are bright. They're blessed with a good queen."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。王はただ、愛する人々のために。\nララ・キングダム憲章の初めに書かれていますわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. The first line of the Kingdom of Lara's charter states: A queen exists only to serve their beloved people."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]